WEBVTT

NOTE English translation of the Polish subtitles burned into the film.

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:04.460
The atlas in a minute. An atlas of Kraków's districts from open public data

2
00:00:04.460 --> 00:00:09.271
Home page: the city's key figures, each with its source.

3
00:00:09.271 --> 00:00:14.283
Questions lead through the city; the map shows the answer.

4
00:00:14.283 --> 00:00:19.497
The map colours change with every question.

5
00:00:19.879 --> 00:00:24.285
Map: all topics of the atlas on one map.

6
00:00:24.285 --> 00:00:29.092
1 km grid layer: residents per grid cell.

7
00:00:29.092 --> 00:00:33.902
District colours: building coverage.

8
00:00:33.902 --> 00:00:38.713
Points: stops by service frequency class.

9
00:00:39.095 --> 00:00:43.902
District profile: indicators, rank among districts and source.

10
00:00:43.902 --> 00:00:48.916
A missing value means no data, not zero.

11
00:00:49.301 --> 00:00:54.106
Comparison: Kraków and Potsdam, same grid, same method.

12
00:00:54.106 --> 00:00:58.916
Only indicators with the same definition are compared.

13
00:00:58.916 --> 00:01:03.924
The rest is listed separately: what is not compared and why.

14
00:01:03.924 --> 00:01:08.938
